1
00:00:05,116 --> 00:00:06,952
( thunder crashing )

2
00:00:12,332 --> 00:00:14,167
( bell tolling )

3
00:00:16,545 --> 00:00:19,005
Kirito: HEY, EUGEO,
ISN’T THAT THE 4:30 BELL?

4
00:00:19,005 --> 00:00:19,923
( Eugeo gasps )

5
00:00:22,008 --> 00:00:24,761
YEAH, IT IS.

6
00:00:24,761 --> 00:00:26,179
Kirito: THEY’RE BOTH LATE.

7
00:00:26,179 --> 00:00:27,514
THAT’S NOT GOOD.

8
00:00:27,514 --> 00:00:30,642
RONIE AND TIESE HAVE
NEVER BEEN LATE BEFORE.

9
00:00:30,642 --> 00:00:31,643
( Eugeo grunts )

10
00:00:31,643 --> 00:00:32,894
( Kirito sighs )

11
00:00:34,604 --> 00:00:36,648
I GOT A BAD FEELING ABOUT THIS.

12
00:00:41,736 --> 00:00:44,322
I’M GONNA GO OVER TO THEIR DORM
AND SEE IF THEY’RE STILL THERE.

13
00:00:44,322 --> 00:00:46,741
THEY MIGHT BE ON THEIR WAY OVER,

14
00:00:46,741 --> 00:00:48,743
SO HOLD DOWN THE FORT
’TIL I GET BACK.

15
00:00:48,743 --> 00:00:50,328
Eugeo: WAIT.
WHY ARE YOU GOING OUT THAT WAY?

16
00:00:50,328 --> 00:00:51,413
USE THE D--

17
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:56,501
I WISH HE’D STOP
USING THE WINDOW.

18
00:00:58,128 --> 00:01:00,046
♪

19
00:01:07,429 --> 00:01:08,722
( knock on door )

20
00:01:08,722 --> 00:01:09,889
( Eugeo sighs )

21
00:01:11,349 --> 00:01:13,310
THANK GOODNESS. WE WERE...

22
00:01:18,523 --> 00:01:21,651
Girl: UH, WOULD YOU HAPPEN
TO BE ELITE DISCIPLE EUGEO?

23
00:01:21,651 --> 00:01:24,529
Eugeo: Y-YES. AND YOU ARE?

24
00:01:24,529 --> 00:01:28,241
Girl: MY NAME IS FRENICA CESKY,
ONE OF THE PRIMARY TRAINEES.

25
00:01:28,241 --> 00:01:30,827
I DO APOLOGIZE
FOR COMING TO SEE YOU

26
00:01:30,827 --> 00:01:32,120
WITHOUT AN APPOINTMENT, SIR.

27
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:33,705
I NEED YOUR HELP.

28
00:01:33,705 --> 00:01:35,582
I DON’T KNOW WHO ELSE TO ASK!

29
00:01:35,582 --> 00:01:38,376
Eugeo: IT’S ALL RIGHT.
TELL ME WHAT’S WRONG.

30
00:01:38,376 --> 00:01:40,670
Frenica: I KNOW
YOU’VE GONE ABOVE AND BEYOND

31
00:01:40,670 --> 00:01:45,050
IN REGARDS TO MY ISSUE
WITH LORD ZIZEK.

32
00:01:45,050 --> 00:01:47,427
I REALLY CAN’T EVEN BEGIN
TO THANK YOU FOR THAT.

33
00:01:49,679 --> 00:01:53,600
UNFORTUNATELY, TONIGHT
I RECEIVED WORD FROM HIM

34
00:01:53,600 --> 00:01:56,144
THAT I AM TO--THAT IS...

35
00:01:56,144 --> 00:01:58,605
HE ORDERED ME
TO PERFORM A SERVICE

36
00:01:58,605 --> 00:02:00,774
THAT I’M MUCH TOO EMBARRASSED
TO REPEAT.

37
00:02:00,774 --> 00:02:02,359
( Eugeo gasps )

38
00:02:02,359 --> 00:02:04,819
( thunder crashing )

39
00:02:04,819 --> 00:02:06,696
Frenica: I TOLD RONIE AND TIESE

40
00:02:06,696 --> 00:02:09,324
THAT IF HE KEPT
GIVING ME ORDERS LIKE THIS,

41
00:02:09,324 --> 00:02:11,951
THERE’S NO WAY
I’D BE ABLE TO STAY HERE.

42
00:02:11,951 --> 00:02:14,412
I’D HAVE TO LEAVE THE ACADEMY.

43
00:02:14,412 --> 00:02:15,830
WHEN I TOLD THEM ALL THIS,

44
00:02:15,830 --> 00:02:18,375
THEY SAID THEY’D GO
TRY TO REASON WITH HIM,

45
00:02:18,375 --> 00:02:20,043
BUT THEY STILL
HAVEN’T COME BACK.

46
00:02:20,043 --> 00:02:23,129
I’M AFRAID
OF WHAT THAT COULD MEAN.

47
00:02:23,129 --> 00:02:23,880
Eugeo: SO AM I.

48
00:02:25,298 --> 00:02:27,425
STAY HERE ’TIL I GET BACK.

49
00:02:27,425 --> 00:02:29,636
♪

50
00:02:29,636 --> 00:02:31,846
SO THIS IS HOW
THEY WANT TO GET EVEN,

51
00:02:31,846 --> 00:02:34,766
BY HURTING RONIE AND TIESE!

52
00:02:34,766 --> 00:02:36,226
♪

53
00:02:36,226 --> 00:02:38,770
♪ SHINY SWORD, MY DIAMOND ♪

54
00:02:38,770 --> 00:02:40,397
( singing in Japanese )

55
00:02:51,533 --> 00:02:52,534
♪ IT’S TIME ♪

56
00:02:52,534 --> 00:02:54,369
( singing in Japanese )

57
00:04:04,647 --> 00:04:06,566
( pounding on door )

58
00:04:08,651 --> 00:04:10,570
( Eugeo grunts )

59
00:04:10,570 --> 00:04:11,946
( pounding )

60
00:04:13,573 --> 00:04:15,116
Humbert: PLEASE, ENTER!

61
00:04:19,913 --> 00:04:22,373
♪

62
00:04:27,921 --> 00:04:30,632
WE JUST UNCORKED
THIS 50-YEAR-OLD BOTTLE

63
00:04:30,632 --> 00:04:33,676
FROM THE WESTERN EMPIRE.
DO JOIN US.

64
00:04:33,676 --> 00:04:36,054
COMMONERS NEVER TASTE
SUCH DELIGHTS.

65
00:04:41,684 --> 00:04:43,686
( Eugeo sighs )

66
00:04:43,686 --> 00:04:45,980
I’M AFRAID I MUST DECLINE.

67
00:04:45,980 --> 00:04:48,691
ANOTHER MATTER BRINGS ME HERE.

68
00:04:48,691 --> 00:04:52,612
I’D LIKE TO KNOW IF MY PAGE,
PRIMARY TRAINEE TIESE SCHTRINEN,

69
00:04:52,612 --> 00:04:56,783
AND DISCIPLE KIRITO’S PAGE,
PRIMARY TRAINEE RONIE ARABEL,

70
00:04:56,783 --> 00:04:58,618
CAME HERE THIS EVENING.

71
00:04:58,618 --> 00:05:00,161
Raios: I SEE.

72
00:05:00,161 --> 00:05:03,039
WHAT A COINCIDENCE
THAT THOSE TWO GIRLS

73
00:05:03,039 --> 00:05:05,041
BELONG TO SIR KIRITO
AND YOURSELF.

74
00:05:05,041 --> 00:05:08,086
THEIR AUDACIOUSNESS
WAS RATHER SURPRISING,

75
00:05:08,086 --> 00:05:12,215
APPROACHING SUCH HIGHLY REGARDED
STUDENTS AS HUMBERT AND MYSELF

76
00:05:12,215 --> 00:05:14,926
AND WITHOUT SO MUCH
AS A FORMAL INVITATION.

77
00:05:14,926 --> 00:05:17,637
THEIR LACK OF COUTH IS FAMILIAR.

78
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:23,768
THAT SAID,
THEY DO NEED TO BE CAREFUL.

79
00:05:23,768 --> 00:05:27,730
ASSERTIVENESS CAN SOMETIMES
BE CONSTRUED AS DISRESPECT.

80
00:05:27,730 --> 00:05:30,608
DO YOU NOT AGREE,
DISCIPLE EUGEO?

81
00:05:30,608 --> 00:05:31,985
( Eugeo gasps )

82
00:05:31,985 --> 00:05:35,071
WE CAN TALK ABOUT
YOUR OPINIONS ANOTHER TIME.

83
00:05:35,071 --> 00:05:37,323
I WANT TO KNOW
WHERE TIESE AND RONIE ARE!

84
00:05:54,966 --> 00:05:55,967
( grunts )

85
00:05:55,967 --> 00:05:56,885
( gasps )

86
00:05:59,721 --> 00:06:00,680
( Humbert chuckles )

87
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:01,890
( Raios chuckles )

88
00:06:01,890 --> 00:06:03,725
( Eugeo gasps )

89
00:06:03,725 --> 00:06:05,435
WHAT IS THIS?!

90
00:06:05,435 --> 00:06:07,103
( girls gasping )

91
00:06:09,898 --> 00:06:13,568
WH-WHAT IS THE MEANING
OF THIS, LORD RAIOS?!

92
00:06:13,568 --> 00:06:16,654
Raios: THESE MEASURES
WERE UNAVOIDABLE, SIR EUGEO.

93
00:06:16,654 --> 00:06:20,325
PRIMARY TRAINEES SCHTRINEN
AND ARABEL DISRESPECTED US

94
00:06:20,325 --> 00:06:24,037
TO SUCH A DEGREE,
MY HAND WAS FORCED.

95
00:06:24,037 --> 00:06:26,247
Eugeo: DISRESPECTED?

96
00:06:26,247 --> 00:06:29,375
Humbert: THEY CLEARLY FORGOT
WHO THEY WERE ADDRESSING.

97
00:06:29,375 --> 00:06:31,711
THESE TWO LESSER NOBLES
HAD THE GALL

98
00:06:31,711 --> 00:06:34,255
TO ACCUSE ME,
A SUPERIOR RANKING NOBLE,

99
00:06:34,255 --> 00:06:38,217
OF USING MY PAGE AS A MEANS
TO SATISFY MY LUSTFUL URGES.

100
00:06:38,217 --> 00:06:39,719
AFTER EVERYTHING I’VE DONE

101
00:06:39,719 --> 00:06:42,972
TO TRY TO GUIDE FRENICA
DOWN THE PROPER PATH.

102
00:06:42,972 --> 00:06:44,349
TALK ABOUT UNGRATEFUL.

103
00:06:44,349 --> 00:06:45,350
( Eugeo gasps )

104
00:06:45,350 --> 00:06:46,726
Raios: BUT LO AND BEHOLD,

105
00:06:46,726 --> 00:06:48,728
THE PLOT DOTH THICKEN.

106
00:06:48,728 --> 00:06:51,564
THEY MADE THE PREPOSTEROUS CLAIM
THAT AS HUMBERT’S ROOMMATE,

107
00:06:51,564 --> 00:06:54,651
I WAS JUST AS RESPONSIBLE
FOR HIS ACTIONS AS HE WAS.

108
00:06:54,651 --> 00:06:58,571
THE IDEA OF SOMEONE
LIKE HER ASKING ME,

109
00:06:58,571 --> 00:07:00,782
THE ELDEST
OF A THIRD-RANK HOUSEHOLD,

110
00:07:00,782 --> 00:07:03,117
"HAVE YOU NO HONOR AS A NOBLE?"

111
00:07:03,117 --> 00:07:05,662
HAVE YOU EVER HEARD
SUCH LUNACY?

112
00:07:05,662 --> 00:07:07,872
( both chuckle )

113
00:07:07,872 --> 00:07:12,752
Eugeo: SIR, EVEN IF EVERYTHING
HAPPENED AS YOU DESCRIBED,

114
00:07:12,752 --> 00:07:15,713
TYING THEM UP AND LOCKING THEM
IN YOUR BEDROOM,

115
00:07:15,713 --> 00:07:19,634
THAT GOES WAY BEYOND YOUR
AUTHORITY TO PUNISH TRAINEES!

116
00:07:19,634 --> 00:07:21,678
Raios: YOU’RE REFERRING
TO THE SCHOOL GUIDELINES?

117
00:07:21,678 --> 00:07:25,890
MY DEAR EUGEO, YOU NEED
TO THINK MUCH LARGER THAN THAT.

118
00:07:25,890 --> 00:07:28,685
DO YOU REMEMBER THIS PASSAGE
FROM THE ACADEMY’S RULES:

119
00:07:28,685 --> 00:07:31,521
"HIGHER LAW TAKES PRECEDENCE
IN ALL CASES"?

120
00:07:31,521 --> 00:07:32,730
( Eugeo gasps )

121
00:07:32,730 --> 00:07:35,358
( Raios chuckles )

122
00:07:35,358 --> 00:07:37,694
HIGHER LAW REFERS
TO THE TABOO INDEX,

123
00:07:37,694 --> 00:07:40,071
AS WELL AS BASIC IMPERIAL LAW.

124
00:07:40,071 --> 00:07:42,073
IN OTHER WORDS,
WHAT I CAN EXERCISE

125
00:07:42,073 --> 00:07:44,117
ON THESE GIRLS OF LOWER RANK

126
00:07:44,117 --> 00:07:47,537
ISN’T A RESULT OF AUTHORITY
GIVEN TO ME BY THIS ACADEMY,

127
00:07:47,537 --> 00:07:49,330
BUT MY POWER AS A NOBLE!

128
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,751
SUCH IS MY SOVEREIGN RIGHT!

129
00:07:53,751 --> 00:07:54,669
( girls scream )

130
00:07:56,629 --> 00:07:58,089
STOP YOUR SQUIRMING,

131
00:07:58,089 --> 00:08:00,675
AND TAKE YOUR PUNISHMENT
LIKE A GOOD GIRL.

132
00:08:10,893 --> 00:08:12,186
Eugeo: LEAVE THEM ALONE!

133
00:08:12,186 --> 00:08:14,605
Raios:
HOLD YOUR GROUND, COMMONER!

134
00:08:14,605 --> 00:08:16,774
THIS JUDGMENT
IS BEING CARRIED OUT

135
00:08:16,774 --> 00:08:19,276
IN COMPLETE ACCORDANCE
WITH BASIC IMPERIAL LAW

136
00:08:19,276 --> 00:08:21,487
AND THE TABOO INDEX.

137
00:08:21,487 --> 00:08:25,574
TO OBSTRUCT SUCH A DECREE
WOULD BE DEEMED A CRIMINAL ACT.

138
00:08:25,574 --> 00:08:27,785
IF YOU TAKE
EVEN ONE STEP CLOSER,

139
00:08:27,785 --> 00:08:30,788
YOU WILL BECOME A CRIMINAL
IN THE EYES OF THE LAW!

140
00:08:30,788 --> 00:08:31,872
Eugeo: YOU CAN’T DO THIS.

141
00:08:32,957 --> 00:08:33,958
( grunts )

142
00:08:33,958 --> 00:08:36,085
MY LEGS!

143
00:08:36,085 --> 00:08:37,545
( grunting )

144
00:08:39,819 --> 00:08:41,507
Ronie: NO! PLEASE, DON'T!

145
00:08:49,057 --> 00:08:54,647
Tiese: NO, NO! PLEASE, NO!

146
00:08:58,357 --> 00:09:00,568
EUGEO! EUGEO!

147
00:09:06,073 --> 00:09:08,200
Kirito: THERE ARE THINGS
YOU JUST SHOULDN’T DO,

148
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:10,953
EVEN IF THERE’S
NO LAW AGAINST IT.

149
00:09:10,953 --> 00:09:14,707
AT THE SAME TIME, THERE MIGHT
BE STUFF YOU SHOULD DO,

150
00:09:14,707 --> 00:09:17,626
EVEN IF THE LAWS
SAY YOU SHOULDN’T.

151
00:09:17,626 --> 00:09:19,628
( Eugeo grunting )

152
00:09:25,301 --> 00:09:26,552
( thunder crashing )

153
00:09:26,563 --> 00:09:28,557
Ronie: NO! STOP IT!

154
00:09:28,967 --> 00:09:32,517
Tiese: EUGEO! HELP ME! PLEASE!

155
00:09:32,516 --> 00:09:35,853
I'M BEGGING YOU! DON'T LET HIM DO THIS!

156
00:09:35,853 --> 00:09:37,730
Eugeo: RONIE AND TIESE

157
00:09:37,730 --> 00:09:41,025
HAD THE COURAGE
TO STAND UP FOR THEIR FRIEND.

158
00:09:41,025 --> 00:09:43,986
WHAT KIND OF LAW
JUSTIFIES PUNISHMENT FOR THAT?!

159
00:09:45,321 --> 00:09:48,532
RAIOS AND HUMBERT
ARE GOING TO DEFILE THEM!

160
00:09:48,537 --> 00:09:51,497
WHAT KIND OF LAW
DOES NOTHING TO STOP THEM?!

161
00:09:51,744 --> 00:09:54,246
EUGEO!

162
00:09:54,246 --> 00:09:57,499
IF UPHOLDING LAWS LIKE THESE
IS MY DUTY, THEN...

163
00:09:59,084 --> 00:10:00,461
THEN I...

164
00:10:00,461 --> 00:10:02,796
I...

165
00:10:06,759 --> 00:10:08,636
( grunting )

166
00:10:08,636 --> 00:10:11,680
( screams )

167
00:10:16,602 --> 00:10:19,063
WHAT’S GOING ON?!

168
00:10:19,063 --> 00:10:22,524
WAIT. THIS HAPPENED BEFORE.

169
00:10:22,524 --> 00:10:24,735
( grunting )

170
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:28,007
THIS IS EVIL!

171
00:10:28,007 --> 00:10:29,657
I HAVE TO...

172
00:10:31,877 --> 00:10:33,577
STOP THEM!

173
00:10:34,078 --> 00:10:35,454
Tiese: HELP US!

174
00:10:35,454 --> 00:10:37,790
PLEASE! EUGEO!

175
00:10:37,790 --> 00:10:39,541
( Raios chuckles )

176
00:10:39,541 --> 00:10:40,876
( both laugh )

177
00:10:44,713 --> 00:10:48,550
( Eugeo screaming )

178
00:10:48,550 --> 00:10:50,219
♪

179
00:10:53,555 --> 00:10:54,223
( Humbert gasps )

180
00:10:59,353 --> 00:11:02,189
( screams )

181
00:11:05,484 --> 00:11:07,152
( Eugeo gasping )

182
00:11:09,446 --> 00:11:10,989
Humbert: MY ARM.

183
00:11:10,989 --> 00:11:13,909
MY ARM IS BLEEDING. HELP!

184
00:11:13,909 --> 00:11:14,910
IT’S NOT STOPPING.

185
00:11:14,910 --> 00:11:17,496
MY LIFE IS DECREASING!

186
00:11:17,496 --> 00:11:20,582
PLEASE, LORD RAIOS,
USE THE SACRED ARTS!

187
00:11:20,582 --> 00:11:23,836
NO, WAIT. A NORMAL SPELL
WON’T HEAL THIS IN TIME.

188
00:11:23,836 --> 00:11:26,797
LIFE ENERGY! HURRY!
SHARE SOME OF YOURS WITH ME!

189
00:11:26,797 --> 00:11:28,048
( whimpering )

190
00:11:28,048 --> 00:11:29,133
( Raios scoffs )

191
00:11:36,432 --> 00:11:38,016
WHAT A THRILL. ( laughs )

192
00:11:38,016 --> 00:11:40,227
NEVER BEFORE HAVE I WITNESSED

193
00:11:40,227 --> 00:11:42,563
SOMEONE COMMIT
SUCH A HEINOUS CRIME!

194
00:11:45,649 --> 00:11:49,319
THE SCOPE OF A NOBLE’S AUTHORITY
ONLY APPLIES TO LESSER NOBLES

195
00:11:49,319 --> 00:11:50,779
AND RUN-OF-THE-MILL
PLEBEIAN SCUM.

196
00:11:50,779 --> 00:11:53,657
( grunts )

197
00:11:53,657 --> 00:11:55,868
BUT FOR ROGUES WHO’VE
BROKEN THE TABOO INDEX,

198
00:11:55,868 --> 00:11:58,704
EXCEPTIONS CAN BE MADE!

199
00:11:58,704 --> 00:12:02,124
( thunder crashes )

200
00:12:02,124 --> 00:12:04,543
( chuckles )
I’VE NEVER USED MY SWORD

201
00:12:04,543 --> 00:12:06,795
TO CUT OFF
SOMEONE’S HEAD BEFORE.

202
00:12:06,795 --> 00:12:09,089
I WILL GAIN
EVEN MORE POWER FROM IT!

203
00:12:09,089 --> 00:12:10,883
( thunder crashes )

204
00:12:10,883 --> 00:12:13,093
YOU ARE NO DISCIPLE NOW.

205
00:12:13,093 --> 00:12:15,846
NO, YOU ARE A CRIMINAL.

206
00:12:15,846 --> 00:12:18,557
IN ACCORDANCE
WITH THE POWERS GRANTED TO ME

207
00:12:18,557 --> 00:12:21,810
AS A THIRD-RANK NOBLE,
I, RAIOS ANTINOUS,

208
00:12:21,810 --> 00:12:24,688
SHALL EXECUTE YOU!

209
00:12:24,688 --> 00:12:25,564
( grunts )

210
00:12:32,863 --> 00:12:34,364
( Eugeo gasps )

211
00:12:38,076 --> 00:12:40,078
KIRITO.

212
00:12:40,078 --> 00:12:42,039
Kirito: BACK OFF, RAIOS.

213
00:12:42,039 --> 00:12:44,666
NO WAY AM I
GONNA LET YOU HURT HIM.

214
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:50,339
Raios: GOOD OF YOU TO JOIN
THE PARTY, DISCIPLE KIRITO.

215
00:12:50,339 --> 00:12:53,175
HOWEVER, I’M AFRAID
YOU’RE A HAIR TOO LATE.

216
00:12:53,175 --> 00:12:55,928
THIS FILTHY SWINE
VIOLATED THE TABOO INDEX

217
00:12:55,928 --> 00:12:59,264
AND IS A CRIMINAL,
SO YOU BEST STAND DOWN.

218
00:12:59,264 --> 00:13:01,975
I SHALL CUT HIS HEAD
FROM HIS NECK,

219
00:13:01,975 --> 00:13:04,853
JUST LIKE THE HEADS
OF YOUR PRECIOUS FLOWERS!

220
00:13:04,853 --> 00:13:07,689
Kirito: I DON’T GIVE A DAMN
ABOUT YOUR TABOOS OR NOBLE CRAP.

221
00:13:07,689 --> 00:13:09,900
EUGEO’S A FRIEND OF MINE,
BUT YOU,

222
00:13:09,900 --> 00:13:11,318
YOU’RE LESS THAN NOTHING.

223
00:13:11,318 --> 00:13:14,613
YOU’RE EVEN LOWER
THAN THE GODDAMN GOBLINS!

224
00:13:14,613 --> 00:13:16,281
( Raios gasping )

225
00:13:19,701 --> 00:13:21,620
( laughs )

226
00:13:21,620 --> 00:13:24,873
TO THINK THAT NOT ONE,
BUT TWO PEASANTS

227
00:13:24,873 --> 00:13:26,959
WOULD COMMIT
SUCH HEINOUS CRIMES!

228
00:13:26,959 --> 00:13:30,587
THIS MEANS I CAN DO AWAY WITH
BOTH OF YOU AT THE SAME TIME!

229
00:13:30,587 --> 00:13:32,881
WHAT A JOYOUS DAY THIS IS.

230
00:13:32,881 --> 00:13:36,385
SURELY THIS IS A DIVINE BLESSING
FROM THE GODDESS STACIA!

231
00:13:44,893 --> 00:13:46,979
( Eugeo gasping )

232
00:13:48,981 --> 00:13:50,482
Kirito: I GOT THIS.

233
00:13:52,985 --> 00:13:54,903
♪

234
00:13:57,990 --> 00:13:58,907
( Eugeo gasps )

235
00:14:04,913 --> 00:14:07,165
( Raios laughs )

236
00:14:07,165 --> 00:14:10,502
THAT PIECE OF JUNK WILL SHATTER
AGAINST MY SECRET TECHNIQUE!

237
00:14:10,502 --> 00:14:11,587
Kirito: WE’LL SEE ABOUT THAT!

238
00:14:15,549 --> 00:14:17,676
( thunder crashing )

239
00:14:20,888 --> 00:14:22,764
( Raios yells )

240
00:14:22,764 --> 00:14:25,392
( Kirito yells )

241
00:14:33,108 --> 00:14:36,069
Raios: WELL, NOW. HOW IS THAT?

242
00:14:36,069 --> 00:14:39,531
YOU CAN’T POSSIBLY HAVE THOUGHT
I, RAIOS ANTINOUS,

243
00:14:39,531 --> 00:14:42,951
WOULD STRUGGLE
AGAINST A PISSANT LIKE YOU!

244
00:14:42,951 --> 00:14:44,536
( yells )

245
00:14:48,040 --> 00:14:49,041
Eugeo: KIRITO!

246
00:14:49,041 --> 00:14:51,251
( Raios grunting )

247
00:14:51,251 --> 00:14:53,170
( Kirito grunting )

248
00:14:54,755 --> 00:14:57,132
( yelling )

249
00:14:57,132 --> 00:14:58,759
♪

250
00:15:07,100 --> 00:15:08,644
( Raios screaming )

251
00:15:13,857 --> 00:15:16,234
MY ARMS!

252
00:15:16,234 --> 00:15:19,196
WH-WH-WHAT HAVE YOU DONE?!

253
00:15:19,196 --> 00:15:21,156
THE BLOOD, IT WON’T STOP!

254
00:15:21,156 --> 00:15:24,117
( gasping )

255
00:15:24,117 --> 00:15:25,744
- HUMBERT!
- ( Humbert gasps )

256
00:15:25,744 --> 00:15:27,162
Raios: HURRY!

257
00:15:27,162 --> 00:15:29,164
MAKE THE BLEEDING STOP!

258
00:15:29,164 --> 00:15:32,793
UNTIE YOUR ROPES,
AND BIND MY ARMS NOW!

259
00:15:32,793 --> 00:15:34,419
Humbert: I CAN’T DO THAT!

260
00:15:34,419 --> 00:15:37,339
IF I UNTIE THIS,
MY LIFE WILL BE DECREASED!

261
00:15:37,339 --> 00:15:40,050
YOU CAN’T ASK ME
TO VIOLATE THE TABOO INDEX!

262
00:15:40,050 --> 00:15:42,970
Raios: HANG THE LAW! HELP ME!

263
00:15:42,970 --> 00:15:46,014
IT’S NOT STOPPING! HUMBERT!

264
00:15:46,014 --> 00:15:48,183
TABOO--YOU MUST--

265
00:15:48,183 --> 00:15:50,227
M-MY LIFE--MY LIFE IS--

266
00:15:50,227 --> 00:15:52,187
( gasping )

267
00:15:52,187 --> 00:15:53,188
TABOO!

268
00:15:53,188 --> 00:15:54,856
( gasps ) MY LIFE--

269
00:15:54,856 --> 00:15:59,987
THE BLOOD! TABOO!

270
00:15:59,987 --> 00:16:01,113
MY LIFE.

271
00:16:01,113 --> 00:16:02,781
MY BLOOD.

272
00:16:02,781 --> 00:16:03,824
THE TABOO.

273
00:16:03,824 --> 00:16:05,909
MY LIFE.

274
00:16:05,909 --> 00:16:08,203
TABOO. LIFE.

275
00:16:08,203 --> 00:16:10,789
THE TABOO! ( gasping )

276
00:16:10,789 --> 00:16:12,332
L-LIFE.

277
00:16:12,332 --> 00:16:14,167
Kirito:
I’LL TIE ’EM OFF FOR YOU.

278
00:16:14,167 --> 00:16:15,752
Raios: MY LIFE!

279
00:16:15,752 --> 00:16:16,920
TABOO!

280
00:16:16,920 --> 00:16:18,880
BLOOD--TABOO!

281
00:16:18,880 --> 00:16:20,841
- ( Kirito gasps )
- Raios: BLOOD! TABOO! TABOO!

282
00:16:20,841 --> 00:16:22,384
TABOO! LIFE! TABOO! LIFE!

283
00:16:22,384 --> 00:16:25,387
TABOO--( overlapping words )

284
00:16:32,728 --> 00:16:35,147
( electronic wail )

285
00:16:35,147 --> 00:16:36,189
( abrupt stop )

286
00:16:37,774 --> 00:16:39,443
- ( wind blowing )
- ( blood trickling )

287
00:16:44,239 --> 00:16:46,324
Kirito: WHAT THE HELL?

288
00:16:46,324 --> 00:16:49,202
WHAT HAPPENED TO HIS FLUCTLIGHT?

289
00:16:49,202 --> 00:16:50,996
( Humbert whimpering )

290
00:16:50,996 --> 00:16:52,456
( wails )

291
00:16:52,456 --> 00:16:54,374
WHAT HAVE YOU DONE TO HIM?!

292
00:16:54,374 --> 00:16:55,375
HE’S--

293
00:16:55,375 --> 00:16:56,793
( whimpering )

294
00:16:56,793 --> 00:16:59,713
AHH! MURDERER!

295
00:16:59,713 --> 00:17:00,839
MONSTER!

296
00:17:00,839 --> 00:17:02,507
( whimpering )

297
00:17:10,348 --> 00:17:11,725
Tiese: I’M SO SORRY.

298
00:17:14,269 --> 00:17:17,481
PLEASE FORGIVE ME, EUGEO.

299
00:17:17,481 --> 00:17:20,067
THIS IS--THIS IS ALL MY FAULT!

300
00:17:20,067 --> 00:17:21,943
Eugeo: NO, IT’S NOT.

301
00:17:21,943 --> 00:17:24,071
YOU’RE NOT TO BLAME FOR THIS.

302
00:17:24,071 --> 00:17:27,741
I AM. THIS HAPPENED BECAUSE I
DIDN’T THINK IT THROUGH.

303
00:17:27,741 --> 00:17:29,159
IT ISN’T YOUR FAULT, TIESE.

304
00:17:29,159 --> 00:17:32,037
Tiese: BUT, EUGEO...

305
00:17:32,037 --> 00:17:33,955
YOUR EYE.

306
00:17:33,955 --> 00:17:37,209
Eugeo: ALL THAT MATTERS NOW
IS THAT YOU AND RONIE ARE SAFE.

307
00:17:37,209 --> 00:17:38,877
I WISH I GOT HERE SOONER.

308
00:17:38,877 --> 00:17:40,754
I’M SORRY.

309
00:17:40,754 --> 00:17:42,839
IT’S MY FAULT THIS ALL HAPPENED.

310
00:17:42,839 --> 00:17:44,674
( Tiese sobbing )

311
00:17:49,721 --> 00:17:51,139
( Ronie sobbing )

312
00:17:51,139 --> 00:17:52,432
( Kirito grunts )

313
00:17:52,432 --> 00:17:54,059
♪

314
00:17:54,059 --> 00:17:57,854
( both gasp )

315
00:17:57,854 --> 00:17:59,231
( Kirito gasps )

316
00:18:03,819 --> 00:18:05,237
( humming )

317
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:12,410
Eugeo: I’VE SEEN THIS BEFORE,

318
00:18:12,410 --> 00:18:14,788
SOMEWHERE A LONG TIME AGO.

319
00:18:17,666 --> 00:18:20,127
Kirito: HOLD ON TO HER!
DON’T LET HER SEE IT!

320
00:18:20,127 --> 00:18:23,421
Stranger: A SINGULAR UNIT
HAS BEEN DETECTED.

321
00:18:23,421 --> 00:18:25,340
TRACING ITS I.D.

322
00:18:25,340 --> 00:18:27,801
COORDINATES FIXED.

323
00:18:27,801 --> 00:18:29,636
REPORT COMPLETE.

324
00:18:35,142 --> 00:18:36,351
( Eugeo sighs )

325
00:18:36,351 --> 00:18:37,978
( curtains rustling )

326
00:18:43,942 --> 00:18:46,987
Humbert: AHH! MURDERER!

327
00:18:46,987 --> 00:18:48,989
MONSTER!

328
00:18:48,989 --> 00:18:51,658
Eugeo: HE’S RIGHT. WHAT AM I?

329
00:18:51,658 --> 00:18:53,910
I’M NO BETTER
THAN THOSE GOBLINS!

330
00:18:58,999 --> 00:19:02,794
Kirito: NO, EUGEO,
YOU’RE HUMAN, SAME AS ME.

331
00:19:02,794 --> 00:19:04,588
SURE, SOMETIMES WE SCREW UP,

332
00:19:04,588 --> 00:19:07,007
BUT WE CAN LEARN FROM IT
AND MAKE IT RIGHT.

333
00:19:07,007 --> 00:19:09,217
THAT’S BEING HUMAN.

334
00:19:09,217 --> 00:19:10,302
Eugeo: KIRITO.

335
00:19:22,272 --> 00:19:24,149
( birds chirping )

336
00:19:31,448 --> 00:19:33,366
( footsteps )

337
00:19:33,366 --> 00:19:34,284
( Kirito sighs )

338
00:19:38,288 --> 00:19:40,832
( keys jangling )

339
00:19:40,832 --> 00:19:42,751
( lock clicking )

340
00:19:49,424 --> 00:19:50,467
Azurica: COME OUT.

341
00:19:57,307 --> 00:19:58,600
STEP CLOSER.

342
00:20:06,024 --> 00:20:07,567
SYSTEM CALL.

343
00:20:07,567 --> 00:20:09,861
GENERATE LUMINOUS ELEMENT.

344
00:20:09,861 --> 00:20:12,405
RECONSTRUCT LOST ORGAN.

345
00:20:16,409 --> 00:20:17,494
GO ON. OPEN IT.

346
00:20:17,494 --> 00:20:18,411
Eugeo: YES, MA’AM.

347
00:20:20,914 --> 00:20:23,250
♪

348
00:20:23,250 --> 00:20:26,044
( gasps )

349
00:20:26,044 --> 00:20:28,546
THANK YOU FOR FIXING IT,
MS. AZURICA!

350
00:20:28,546 --> 00:20:30,131
Azurica: YOU ARE MOST WELCOME.

351
00:20:30,131 --> 00:20:31,508
NOW LISTEN CAREFULLY.

352
00:20:31,508 --> 00:20:33,134
YOUR ESCORT IS COMING FOR YOU.

353
00:20:33,134 --> 00:20:34,970
I MUST HAND YOU OVER TO THEM

354
00:20:34,970 --> 00:20:37,138
AND HAVE NO CHOICE
IN THE MATTER.

355
00:20:37,138 --> 00:20:39,766
I’D LIKE TO SAY A FEW WORDS
BEFORE THAT HAPPENS.

356
00:20:41,393 --> 00:20:43,645
DISCIPLE EUGEO,

357
00:20:43,645 --> 00:20:47,190
BREAKING THAT SEAL IS SOMETHING
I WAS NEVER ABLE TO DO,

358
00:20:47,190 --> 00:20:51,528
AND, AS A RESULT, YOU SHOULD
BE ABLE TO GO WHERE I CANNOT.

359
00:20:51,528 --> 00:20:54,239
HAVE FAITH IN YOUR SWORD
AND IN YOUR FRIEND.

360
00:20:55,949 --> 00:20:57,993
DISCIPLE KIRITO,

361
00:20:57,993 --> 00:20:59,619
IN ALL THE TIME YOU WERE HERE,

362
00:20:59,619 --> 00:21:02,831
I NEVER GOT TO KNOW
WHO YOU REALLY ARE.

363
00:21:02,831 --> 00:21:05,583
THAT SAID, I DO KNOW
EVERYTHING HERE WILL CHANGE

364
00:21:05,583 --> 00:21:08,503
ONCE YOU REACH THE TOWER.

365
00:21:08,503 --> 00:21:10,839
EVEN IF
I CAN’T HELP YOU DIRECTLY,

366
00:21:10,839 --> 00:21:14,092
I’LL BE PRAYING THAT YOU
FIND THE TRUTH, ALWAYS.

367
00:21:15,218 --> 00:21:17,137
♪

368
00:21:40,243 --> 00:21:42,662
Eugeo: I’VE SEEN
THIS KIND OF BLUE AND GOLD

369
00:21:42,662 --> 00:21:45,290
SOMEWHERE BEFORE, BUT WHERE?

370
00:21:46,624 --> 00:21:48,793
Woman: I AM THE INTEGRITY KNIGHT

371
00:21:48,793 --> 00:21:51,504
WHO OVERSEES
THE CAPITAL OF CENTORIA.

372
00:21:54,549 --> 00:21:55,884
( Eugeo gasps )

373
00:22:01,931 --> 00:22:04,684
Alice: I AM
ALICE SYNTHESIS THIRTY.

374
00:22:04,684 --> 00:22:05,685
♪

375
00:22:05,685 --> 00:22:07,604
( singing in Japanese )

376
00:22:42,263 --> 00:22:45,850
♪ THE IRIS TO YOU ♪

